op\u0026fm=png"},{"width":30,"height":30,"url":"https://img.novydenik.com/wp-static/2026/07/profimedia-1117498488.jpg?w=30\u0026h=30\u0026fit=crop\u0026fm=png"},{"width":40,"height":40,"url":"https://img.novydenik.com/wp-static/2026/07/profimedia-1117498488.jpg?w=40\u0026h=40\u0026fit=crop\u0026fm=png"},{"width":60,"height":60,"url":"https://img.novydenik.com/wp-static/2026/07/profimedia-1117498488.jpg?w=60\u0026h=60\u0026fit=crop\u0026fm=png"},{"width":80,"height":80,"url":"https://img.novydenik.com/wp-static/2026/07/profimedia-1117498488.jpg?w=80\u0026h=80\u0026fit=crop\u0026fm=png"},{"width":256,"height":256,"url":"https://img.novydenik.com/wp-static/2026/07/profimedia-1117498488.jpg?w=256\u0026h=256\u0026fit=crop\u0026fm=png"}]},"excerpt":"","tags":[],"followable":true,"settings":[],"featured_text":"","parent_category":13,"url_spotify":null,"url_applepodcasts":null,"url_youtube":null,"url_more":null}],"image":null,"title":"Zemřel Jorge Messi","embed":[],"seen":false,"forceNotSeen":false,"published_at_date":1786196815000,"isImportant":false,"isCollapsed":false,"shouldHideImageOnHome":false,"excerptOriginal":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eZemřel Jorge Messi, otec argentinské fotbalové legendy Lionela Messiho.\u003c/strong\u003e Fotbalové hvězdě dělal agenta a manažera. Bylo mu 68 let. (\u003ca data-link=\"ext\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" href=\"https://elpais.com/deportes/futbol/2026-08-08/muere-jorge-messi-padre-de-leo-messi-a-los-68-anos.html\"\u003eEl País\u003c/a\u003e) \u003c!--Poslední typografie: Marie Golková 8. 8. 2026 15:46:40--\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n","hasReadMore":false},{"excerpt":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePrezident FIFA Gianni Infantino měl v době působení v UEFA pro svou spolupracovnici a údajnou milenku zajistit vysoké odstupné,\u003c/strong\u003e napsal britský list \u003ca data-link=\"ext\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.telegraph.co.uk/sport/2026/08/07/gianni-infantinos-lover-was-paid-off-by-uefa/\"\u003eTelegraph\u003c/a\u003e. Evropská fotbalová unie platbu ženě potvrdila, světová federace popřela, že by se její současný šéf dopustil nevhodného chování. (\u003ca data-link=\"ext\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.ceskenoviny.cz/zpravy/telegraph-infantino-zajistil-milence-vysoke-odstupne/2859891\"\u003eČeské noviny\u003c/a\u003e)\u003c!--Poslední typografie: Sylvie Zbraňková 8. 8. 2026 14:53:05--\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n","content":"","id":2150417,"url":"https://denikn.cz/minuta/2150417/","published_at":"2026-08-08T14:45:27+02:00","tags":[{"type":"tag","id":304,"slug":"fotbal","url":"https://denikn.cz/tag/fotbal/","name":"Fotbal","image":{"id":304,"excerpt":"","sizes":[{"width":200,"height":134,"url":"https://denikn.cz/api/feature/tag/304/?w=200\u0026h=134"},{"width":720,"height":480,"url":"https://denikn.cz/api/feature/tag/304/?w=720\u0026h=480"},{"width":1600,"height":1067,"url":"https://denikn.cz/api/feature/tag/304/?w=1600\u0026h=1067"},{"width":2400,"height":1600,"url":"https://denikn.cz/api/feature/tag/304/?w=2400\u0026h=1600"}]},"icon":{"id":2131522,"excerpt":"Šéf FIFA Gianni Infantino a Donald Trump předávali trofej vítězi. Foto: Heuler Andrey, DiaEsportivo / imago sportfotodienst / ČTK","sizes":[{"width":15,"height":15,"url":"https://img.novydenik.com/wp-static/2026/07/profimedia-1117498488.jpg?w=15\u0026h=15\u0026fit=crop\u0026fm=png"},{"width":20,"height":20,"url":"https://img.novydenik.com/wp-static/2026/07/profimedia-1117498488.jpg?w=20\u0026h=20\u0026fit=crop\u0026fm=png"},{"width":30,"height":30,"url":"https://img.novydenik.com/wp-static/2026/07/profimedia-1117498488.jpg?w=30\u0026h=30\u0026fit=crop\u0026fm=png"},{"width":40,"height":40,"url":"https://img.novydenik.com/wp-static/2026/07/profimedia-1117498488.jpg?w=40\u0026h=40\u0026fit=crop\u0026fm=png"},{"width":60,"height":60,"url":"https://img.novydenik.com/wp-static/2026/07/profimedia-1117498488.jpg?w=60\u0026h=60\u0026fit=crop\u0026fm=png"},{"width":80,"height":80,"url":"https