ilánském stadionu San Siro. Foto: Ashley Landis / AP / ČTK","sizes":[{"width":15,"height":15,"url":"https://img.novydenik.com/wp-static/2026/02/IMG1755jpeg.jpg?w=15\u0026h=15\u0026fit=crop\u0026fm=png"},{"width":20,"height":20,"url":"https://img.novydenik.com/wp-static/2026/02/IMG1755jpeg.jpg?w=20\u0026h=20\u0026fit=crop\u0026fm=png"},{"width":30,"height":30,"url":"https://img.novydenik.com/wp-static/2026/02/IMG1755jpeg.jpg?w=30\u0026h=30\u0026fit=crop\u0026fm=png"},{"width":40,"height":40,"url":"https://img.novydenik.com/wp-static/2026/02/IMG1755jpeg.jpg?w=40\u0026h=40\u0026fit=crop\u0026fm=png"},{"width":60,"height":60,"url":"https://img.novydenik.com/wp-static/2026/02/IMG1755jpeg.jpg?w=60\u0026h=60\u0026fit=crop\u0026fm=png"},{"width":80,"height":80,"url":"https://img.novydenik.com/wp-static/2026/02/IMG1755jpeg.jpg?w=80\u0026h=80\u0026fit=crop\u0026fm=png"},{"width":256,"height":256,"url":"https://img.novydenik.com/wp-static/2026/02/IMG1755jpeg.jpg?w=256\u0026h=256\u0026fit=crop\u0026fm=png"}]},"excerpt":"","tags":[],"followable":true,"settings":[],"featured_text":"","parent_category":13,"url_spotify":null,"url_applepodcasts":null,"url_youtube":null,"url_more":null}],"image":null,"title":"","embed":[],"seen":false,"forceNotSeen":false,"published_at_date":1786170738000,"isImportant":false,"isCollapsed":false,"shouldHideImageOnHome":false,"excerptOriginal":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eČeští hokejisté do 18 let skončili na turnaji Hlinka Gretzky Cup v\u0026nbsp;Edmontonu šestí,\u003c/strong\u003e v závěrečném utkání prohráli se Švýcarskem 1:5. (\u003ca data-link=\"ext\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.ceskenoviny.cz/zpravy/hokejova-osmnactka-na-hlinka-gretzky-cupu-prohrala-se-svycary-a-skoncila-sesta/2859853\"\u003eČeské noviny\u003c/a\u003e)\u003c!--Poslední typografie: Jana Doležalová 8. 8. 2026 8:31:03--\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n","hasReadMore":false},{"excerpt":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMajitelka Dynama České Budějovice Nneka Ede odmítla nabídku Jihočeského kraje ve výši 32,5 milionu korun na odkup klubu.\u003c/strong\u003e Třetiligový fotbalový klub zároveň oznámil, že nepřihlásí svůj B tým do čtvrté nejvyšší soutěže. Od FAČR za to dostal pokutu 500 tisíc korun. (\u003ca data-link=\"ext\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.ceskenoviny.cz/zpravy/majitelka-fotbaloveho-dynama-odmitla-nabidku-jihoceskeho-kraje-na-odkup-klubu/2858963\"\u003eČeské noviny\u003c/a\u003e)\u003c!--Poslední typografie: Julie Petříková 7. 8. 2026 22:28:22--\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n","content":"","id":2150194,"url":"https://denikn.cz/minuta/2150194/","published_at":"2026-08-07T22:27:49+02:00","tags":[{"type":"tag","id":304,"slug":"fotbal","url":"https://denikn.cz/tag/fotbal/","name":"Fotbal","image":{"id":304,"excerpt":"","sizes":[{"width":200,"height":134,"url":"https://denikn.cz/api/feature/tag/304/?w=200\u0026h=134"},{"width":720,"height":480,"url":"https://denikn.cz/api/feature/tag/304/?w=720\u0026h=480"},{"width":1600,"height":1067,"url":"https://denikn.cz/api/feature/tag/304/?w=1600\u0026h=1067"},{"width":2400,"height":1600,"url":"https://denikn.cz/api/feature/tag/304/?w=2400\u0026h=1600"}]},"icon":{"id":2131522,"excerpt":"Šéf FIFA Gianni Infantino a Donald Trump předávali trofej vítězi. Foto: Heuler Andrey, DiaEsportivo / imago sportfotodienst / ČTK","sizes":[{"width":15,"height":15,"url":"https://img.novydenik.com/wp-static/2026/07/profimedia-1117498488.jpg?w=15\u0026h=15\u0026fit=crop\u0026fm=png"},{"width":20,"height":20,"url":"https://img.novydenik.com/wp-static/2026/07/profimedia-1117498488.jpg?w=20\u0026h=20\u0026fit=crop\u0026fm=png"},{"width":30,"height":30,"url":"https://img.novydenik.com/wp-static/2026/07/profimedia-1117498488.jpg?w=30\u0026h=30\u0026fit=crop\u0026fm=png"},{"width":40,"height":40,"url":"https://img.novydenik.com/wp-static/2026/07/profimedia-1117498488.jpg?w=40\u0026h=40\u0026fit=crop\u0026fm=png"},{"width":60,"height":60,"url":"https://img.novydenik.com/wp-static/2026/07/