url_applepodcasts":null,"url_youtube":null,"url_more":null}],"image":null,"title":"Předseda norského fotbalového svazu vyzval prezidenta FIFA, aby odstoupil","embed":[],"seen":false,"forceNotSeen":false,"published_at_date":1786099420000,"isImportant":false,"isCollapsed":false,"shouldHideImageOnHome":false,"excerptOriginal":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca data-link=\"int\" href=\"https://denikn.cz/minuta/2149508/?ref=mwat\"\u003ePředseda norského fotbalového svazu vyzval prezidenta FIFA Infantina, aby odstoupil, a další země, aby se k výzvě přidaly.\u003c/a\u003e Už včera UEFA zopakovala, že Infantino „ztratil důvěru“.\u003c/p\u003e\n","hasReadMore":true,"readMoreCountOfWords":24},{"excerpt":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eV noci skončila na turnaji v Torontu poslední z osmi českých tenistek.\u003c/strong\u003e Bartůňková ve 3. kole prohrála s Anisimovou 6:3, 0:6, 4:6. V Montrealu naopak postoupil do osmifinále Lehečka přes Blockxe 6:3, 6:4. (\u003ca data-link=\"ext\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.espn.com/tennis/scoreboard/_/date/20260806\"\u003eESPN\u003c/a\u003e) \u003c!--Poslední typografie: Veronika Vindyšová 7. 8. 2026 8:54:03--\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n","content":"","id":2149180,"url":"https://denikn.cz/minuta/2149180/","published_at":"2026-08-07T08:54:23+02:00","tags":[{"type":"tag","id":945,"slug":"tenis","url":"https://denikn.cz/tag/tenis/","name":"Tenis","image":{"id":945,"excerpt":"","sizes":[{"width":200,"height":134,"url":"https://denikn.cz/api/feature/tag/945/?w=200\u0026h=134"},{"width":720,"height":480,"url":"https://denikn.cz/api/feature/tag/945/?w=720\u0026h=480"},{"width":1600,"height":1067,"url":"https://denikn.cz/api/feature/tag/945/?w=1600\u0026h=1067"},{"width":2400,"height":1600,"url":"https://denikn.cz/api/feature/tag/945/?w=2400\u0026h=1600"}]},"icon":{"id":1192907,"excerpt":"Markéta Vondroušová. Foto: Kin Cheung, ČTK/AP","sizes":[{"width":15,"height":15,"url":"https://img.novydenik.com/wp-static/2023/07/profimedia-0788908194.jpg?w=15\u0026h=15\u0026fit=crop\u0026fm=png"},{"width":20,"height":20,"url":"https://img.novydenik.com/wp-static/2023/07/profimedia-0788908194.jpg?w=20\u0026h=20\u0026fit=crop\u0026fm=png"},{"width":30,"height":30,"url":"https://img.novydenik.com/wp-static/2023/07/profimedia-0788908194.jpg?w=30\u0026h=30\u0026fit=crop\u0026fm=png"},{"width":40,"height":40,"url":"https://img.novydenik.com/wp-static/2023/07/profimedia-0788908194.jpg?w=40\u0026h=40\u0026fit=crop\u0026fm=png"},{"width":60,"height":60,"url":"https://img.novydenik.com/wp-static/2023/07/profimedia-0788908194.jpg?w=60\u0026h=60\u0026fit=crop\u0026fm=png"},{"width":80,"height":80,"url":"https://img.novydenik.com/wp-static/2023/07/profimedia-0788908194.jpg?w=80\u0026h=80\u0026fit=crop\u0026fm=png"},{"width":256,"height":256,"url":"https://img.novydenik.com/wp-static/2023/07/profimedia-0788908194.jpg?w=256\u0026h=256\u0026fit=crop\u0026fm=png"}]},"excerpt":"","tags":[],"followable":true,"settings":[],"featured_text":"","parent_category":13,"url_spotify":null,"url_applepodcasts":null,"url_youtube":null,"url_more":null}],"image":null,"title":"","embed":[],"seen":false,"forceNotSeen":false,"published_at_date":1786085663000,"isImportant":false,"isCollapsed":false,"shouldHideImageOnHome":false,"excerptOriginal":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eV noci skončila na turnaji v Torontu poslední z osmi českých tenistek.\u003c/strong\u003e Bartůňková ve 3. kole prohrála s Anisimovou 6:3, 0:6, 4:6. V Montrealu naopak postoupil do osmifinále Lehečka přes Blockxe 6:3, 6:4. (\u003ca data-link=\"ext\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.espn.com/tennis/scoreboard/_/date/20260806\"\u003eESPN\u003c/a\u003e) \u003c!--Poslední typografie: Veronika Vindyšová 7. 8. 2026 8:54:03--\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n","hasReadMore":false},{"excerpt":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHrozba bojkotu příštího MS ve fotbale ze strany UEFA trvá, oznámila evropská federace.\u003c/strong\u003e A to navzdory tomu, že FIFA odstoupila od kritizovaného plánu prodat část MS soukromým investorům. Podle UEFA nezaručila, že se to nebude opakovat. Federace zopakovala, že „ztratila důvěru v prezidentství Gianniho Infantina“. (\u003ca data-link=\"ext\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.bbc.com/sport/football/articles/c2k74yevgzwo\"\u003eBBC\u003c/a\u003e) \u003c!--Poslední typografie: Kateřina Libovická 6. 8. 2026 21:55:46--\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n","content":"","id":2149006,"url":"https://denikn.cz/minuta/2149006/","published_at":"2026-08-06T21:56:13+02:00","tags":[{"type":"tag","id":304,"slug":"fotbal","url":"https://denikn.cz/tag/fotbal/","name":"Fotbal","image":{"id":304,"excerpt":"","sizes":[{"width":200,"height":134,"url":"https://denikn.cz/api/feature/tag/304/?w=200\u0026h=134"},{"width":720,"height":480,"url":"https://denikn.cz/api/feature/tag/304/?w=720\u0026h=480"},{"width":1600,"height":1067,"url":"https://denikn.cz/api/feature/tag/304/?w=1600\u0026h=1067"},{"width":2400,"height":1600,"url":"https://denikn.cz/api/feature/tag/304/?w=2400\u0026h=1600"}]},"icon":{"id":2131522,"excerpt":"Šéf FIFA Gianni Infantino a Donald Trump předávali trofej vítězi. Foto: Heuler Andrey, DiaEsportivo / imago sportfotodienst / ČTK","sizes":[{"width":15,"height":15,"url":"https://img.novydenik.com/wp-static/2026/07/profimedia-1117498488.jpg?w=15\u0026h=15\u0026fit=crop\u0026fm=png"},{"width":20,"height":20,"url":"https://img.novydenik.com/wp-static/2026/07/profimedia-1117498488.jpg?w=20\u0026h=20\u0026fit=crop\u0026fm=png"},{"width":30,"height":30,"url":"https://img.novydenik.com/wp-static/2026/07/profimedia-1117498488.jpg?w=30\u0026h=30\u0026fit=crop\u0026fm=png"},{"width":40,"height":40,"url":"https://img.novydenik.com/wp-static/2026/07/profimedia-1117498488.jpg?w=40\u0026h=40\u0026fit=crop\u0026fm=png"},{"width":60,"height":60,"url":"https://img.novydenik.com/wp-static/2026/07/profimedia-1117498488.jpg?w=60\u0026h=60\u0026fit=crop\u0026fm=png"},{"width":80,"height":80,"url":"https://img.novydenik.c