án na prodej podílu na světových šampionátech soukromým investorům.\u003c!--Poslední typografie: Alena Mikulíková 2. 8. 2026 14:04:28--\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n","hasReadMore":true,"readMoreCountOfWords":76},{"excerpt":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eČeská tenistka Darja Viďmanová postoupila do finále turnaje WTA v Memphisu\u003c/strong\u003e, v\u0026nbsp;semifinále porazila dvakrát 6:3 Mexiačanku Zarazúa. O\u0026nbsp;vítězství v\u0026nbsp;turnaji si třiadvacetiletá Češka zahraje s\u0026nbsp;Ruskou Kristinou Ljutovou. (WTA) \u003c!--Poslední typografie: Marie Dámková 1. 8. 2026 23:45:58--\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n","content":"","id":2143974,"url":"https://denikn.cz/minuta/2143974/","published_at":"2026-08-01T23:46:08+02:00","tags":[{"type":"tag","id":945,"slug":"tenis","url":"https://denikn.cz/tag/tenis/","name":"Tenis","image":{"id":945,"excerpt":"","sizes":[{"width":200,"height":134,"url":"https://denikn.cz/api/feature/tag/945/?w=200\u0026h=134"},{"width":720,"height":480,"url":"https://denikn.cz/api/feature/tag/945/?w=720\u0026h=480"},{"width":1600,"height":1067,"url":"https://denikn.cz/api/feature/tag/945/?w=1600\u0026h=1067"},{"width":2400,"height":1600,"url":"https://denikn.cz/api/feature/tag/945/?w=2400\u0026h=1600"}]},"icon":{"id":1192907,"excerpt":"Markéta Vondroušová. Foto: Kin Cheung, ČTK/AP","sizes":[{"width":15,"height":15,"url":"https://img.novydenik.com/wp-static/2023/07/profimedia-0788908194.jpg?w=15\u0026h=15\u0026fit=crop\u0026fm=png"},{"width":20,"height":20,"url":"https://img.novydenik.com/wp-static/2023/07/profimedia-0788908194.jpg?w=20\u0026h=20\u0026fit=crop\u0026fm=png"},{"width":30,"height":30,"url":"https://img.novydenik.com/wp-static/2023/07/profimedia-0788908194.jpg?w=30\u0026h=30\u0026fit=crop\u0026fm=png"},{"width":40,"height":40,"url":"https://img.novydenik.com/wp-static/2023/07/profimedia-0788908194.jpg?w=40\u0026h=40\u0026fit=crop\u0026fm=png"},{"width":60,"height":60,"url":"https://img.novydenik.com/wp-static/2023/07/profimedia-0788908194.